<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange higher in heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 38.49 to 6765.37, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.08 to 406.12, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share finished up $0.12.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1330 to 1185.</p>
<p>Volume was 532,313,930 compared with 524,994,520 on Wednesday.</p>
